🚀 Complete Employee Management API Roadmap
Step	Topic	Main Concepts
1	Project Setup	Node, Express, structure, npm, env
2	User & Register	User model, MongoDB, Mongoose, validation
3	Password Security	Hashing, bcrypt, salt, password verification
4	Login	Authentication, credentials, login flow
5	JWT	JWT structure, signing, verification, expiry
6	Access Token	Protected routes, auth middleware
7	Refresh Token	Token rotation, expiry, new access token
8	Cookies	HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite, cookie security
9	Logout	Token invalidation, logout flow
10	Sessions	Session-based auth + JWT vs Session
11	Roles / RBAC	Admin, Manager, Employee
12	Permissions	Fine-grained permissions
13	Authorization	Role + permission middleware
14	OAuth 2.0	Google Login, OAuth flow
15	Security	CORS, CSRF, XSS, rate limiting, Helmet
16	Testing	Postman, test cases, edge cases, Jest/Supertest
17	Production Architecture	Error handling, logging, validation, clean structure
18	Docker & Database	Docker, MongoDB, environment configuration
19	Deployment	Cloud deployment, production environment, HTTPS
20	Final Production Project	Complete testing + debugging + optimization
Har step mein mera teaching pattern

Main sirf code nahi dunga. Har feature ke liye:

1. Problem → real company mein ye problem kyun aati hai
2. Concept → actually technology kya kar rahi hai
3. Decision → senior developer kya decide karega aur kyun
4. Code → khud implement karenge
5. Postman → API ko test karenge
6. Edge cases → galat input/security cases
7. Debugging → error aaye to kaise sochna hai
8. Interview thinking → interviewer kya pooch sakta hai
9. Production → real application mein kaise karte hain

Aur end mein tumhare paas sirf authentication ka demo nahi, balki proper production-style backend project hoga.

Total: 20 major steps, lekin zarurat padne par kisi important topic ko extra sub-step mein todunga—kisi concept ko sirf roadmap complete karne ke liye skip nahi karunga.